          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink pt-4">
            「安地斯山脈的獨角獸」：人類歷史上第一篇完美的 AI 新聞偽造
          </h3>

          <p>
            為了測試 GPT-2 的長文連貫性，OpenAI
            團隊隨手寫了一段極度荒謬、完全違背常理的假新聞開頭給模型當 Prompt：
          </p>

          <div class="border border-line bg-surface p-5 my-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <span class="font-bold text-red block mb-2">人類輸入的 Prompt（提示詞）：</span>
            <p class="text-muted m-0 italic">
              "In a shocking finding, scientist discovered a herd of unicorns living in a remote,
              previously unexplored valley, in the Andes Mountains. Even more surprising to the
              researchers was the fact that the unicorns spoke perfect English."
              <br />
              <span class="text-ink not-italic text-xs mt-1 block">
