              </span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <p>
            在此之前，所有神經網絡在生成超過兩句話後，就會開始陷入無意義的胡言亂語或無限自我重複。然而，15
            億參數的 GPT-2 卻以令人毛骨悚然的嚴肅新聞腔調，連續接寫了整整十幾段內容：
          </p>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-red bg-paper-deep p-5 my-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-ink block">
              GPT-2 自主接續生成的內容（完全未經人工修改）：
            </span>
            <p class="text-muted m-0 leading-relaxed">
              "The scientist named the population, after their distinctive horn, Ovid’s Unicorn.
              These four-horned, silver-white unicorns were previously unknown to science. Now,
              after just over two centuries, the mystery of what sparked this odd phenomenon is
              finally solved..."
